# What Vercel uploads or checks out. Leading slashes anchor a pattern to the repo root: without one, a name like
# "data" would also drop apps/web/src/site/data (the case-study data the site is built from).
/.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
/apps/web/dist-ssr
/engine/.pgdata
/engine/tests
/.impeccable
/research
/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
